        "line": 166,
        "text": "theorem cutResidual_smoothOn {A v : VelocityField} {p : PressureField} {U : Set SpaceTime}\n    (hU : IsOpen U) (hA : ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ A U)\n    (hv : ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ v U) (hp : ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ p U) :\n    ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ (cutResidual A v p) U"
